backtest: 30 fixtures replayed

[hand-built] sandwich: frontrun-victim-backrun bracket on a WETH/TKN pool
  caught      block 100 sandwich Sandwich
[hand-built] arb: two-hop closed-cycle WETH -> USDC -> WETH
  caught      block 200 arb Arbitrage
[hand-built] flashloan: 100 WETH borrowed and repaid with a fee in one tx
  caught      block 300 flashloan Flashloan
[hand-built] liquidation: 8% bonus seizure of WETH collateral for USDC debt
  caught      block 400 liquidation Liquidation
[hand-built] rugpull: 90% of a pool's TKN reserve drained in one tx
  caught      block 500 rugpull Rugpull
[hand-built] wash-trading: buy/sell/buy/sell round trip on one pool over 4 blocks
  caught      block 603 wash-trading WashTrading
[hand-built] address-poisoning: zero-value bait from an 8-nibble lookalike
  caught      block 700 address-poisoning AddressPoisoning
[hand-built] clean: one ordinary swap and one plain transfer, no incident
